<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-14T17:24:47.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:24:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs are kidnapping local officials to force the release of detained members, while Mexico's defense minister warns cartels are increasingly using drones for attacks. The U.S. Treasury has sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel-controlled horse-racing and business network, and cartels are stealing U.S. rental cars and trucks to convert them into armored vehicles for cross-border operations. Flooding from Hurricane Simon and Tropical Storm Rachel remnants killed six people, including children, in Mexico. The UCDP recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNVGM2dm9HNmlqTkdMODFpV09LT2YxRWloWXUtTk5KaFV1NTVxWDMtNlRwZDY3Z2M3WFBpZ2JVS2tsVUY5eko1Mldtd3RPMTM3aFFaNGZYS3dZbkZvbjZLelNISHB1dlk1Z3B2Zy1xWVJudzhIaXVXeWNjQkxIX2x5VThzUnZ1Y25HTjV5eHBVNm1jSlk3S1c2Qm90ZkZLUkRpU3JHX18tdld4U0U0R2hhVHdwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPOXhDQ3dIbkpmRndpS3NsTFF4SDdIb3Y4QVh2dXEwZDQzME1jRHY4cHlXVmdEV2h3anRMRXB6Uld5YWt0SGxFeklpTl9xdGk1ODJIbUFaYmc4R1M2cWZ1dHNITVVRZzI1N0JCbG43UW83QXJVYjQ5anRnbzFsYTBjcFNTdWt0YWtQeGFJRGNGSTkwUjFvdDJJVVJ4QkRUSkQ4QmdJUG56UC1BWjBIaVk5dmdpTktZcThm?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQRk8tVlAzWjJIVFRsWklIRWVDVVJBU2EzcTlvalNWWTdfUnA4R2tfSHhMaDFmRXBQWFpacTFPcVIwRnZaRHFkV0RDLVI0dTVKQ1dwZzlkeTNUMjNyV2EzVG43WjhqU1ptSVI4alZmOC0zSUJKQUZwbi00WFcxeDQtNWRIV0dfOHJVY1JJczgxUm4xeUo0RDFFTmhpTzg1eENGeWFNLXRhMFN0REI2ZnpGdWMxRUFVOExmYi1jM3RmbDliLTU2a3Yw?oc